# GSD Presentation Package: "The Digital Dojo" (Visual Edition)

> **Aesthetic**: Far East Ancient Spiritual Elegance x Hyper-Realism.
> **Key Elements**: Jade, Imperial Gold, Deep Void Black, Porcelain, Silk, Glitch.

