## 3. How to Share Your Files With Me

**1. PDF**:
*   **Yes!** If you have the file on your computer, you can explain what it is, and I can tell you how to upload it or just paste the text content if it's text-heavy. If it's visual, describe it!

**2. Canva**:
*   **Direct Link**: If you set the Canva link to "Public View", I might be able to read the HTML, but I cannot "see" the slides like a human.
*   **Better**: Export the Canva presentation as a **PDF** and share that. Or, take screenshots of key slides and save them to your folder so I can use `view_file` to see the file names (I can't see the images themselves yet, but I can help you organize them).
*   **Best**: share the text/content, and I will be your "Creative Director" telling you what visuals to put on each slide in Canva.
